[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200300_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200300_01_0010","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200300_01_0020","text":"……\n…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200300_01_0030","text":"────原来如此，是儿童节目用的VTR啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200300_01_0040","text":"是的！所以，总之要拍得开心！\n我想做成热闹的影像"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200300_01_0050","text":"总之……\n开心……热闹……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200300_01_0060","text":"也希望放学后CLIMAX GIRLS的各位，\n能笑容满满地配合我们！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200300_01_0070","text":"笑容……\n满满地……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200300_01_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200300_01_0080","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200300_01_0090","text":"如果……\n不能满满地……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200300_01_0100","text":"……再一次……"}]
